{"id":"n2-180","title":"～切る (〜kiru)","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"To do something completely or thoroughly.","longExplanation":"The ～切る grammar point is added to the verb stem (masu-form) to express doing something completely or thoroughly, often implying a strong sense of finishing or using up everything.","formation":"Verb-stem + 切る","examples":[{"jp":"彼は試験勉強をがんばり切るつもりだ。","romaji":"Kare wa shiken benkyou o ganbari kiru tsumori da.","en":"He intends to give his absolute all to exam study.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"試験","vocabId":"1312350","reading":"しけん"},{"surface":"勉強","vocabId":"1512670","reading":"べんきょう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"がんばり","vocabId":"1614350","reading":"がんばり","baseForm":"がんばる"},{"surface":"切る","vocabId":"1384830","reading":"きる"},{"surface":"つもり","vocabId":null},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[6]},{"jp":"この仕事を終わり切るまで、帰らないでください。","romaji":"Kono shigoto o owari kiru made, kaeranai de kudasai.","en":"Please don't go home until you've completely finished this job.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"仕事","vocabId":"1304970","reading":"しごと"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"終わり","vocabId":"1589590","reading":"おわり","baseForm":"終わる"},{"surface":"切る","vocabId":"1384830","reading":"きる"},{"surface":"まで","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"帰ら","vocabId":"1221270","reading":"かえる","baseForm":"帰る"},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ください","vocabId":"1184270","reading":"ください","baseForm":"くださる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4]},{"jp":"友達と喧嘩して、何も言い切れなかった。","romaji":"Tomodachi to kenka shite, nanimo iikirenakatta.","en":"I argued with my friend and couldn't say everything I wanted to say.","words":[{"surface":"友達","vocabId":"1540170","reading":"ともだち"},{"surface":"と","vocabId":null},{"surface":"喧嘩","vocabId":"1257040","reading":"けんか"},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"何","vocabId":"1577100","reading":"なに"},{"surface":"も","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言い","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"切れ","vocabId":"1384840","reading":"きれ","baseForm":"切れる"},{"surface":"なかっ","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[]},{"jp":"彼らは、そのゲームをやり切ることができました。","romaji":"Karera wa, sono geemu o yarikiru koto ga dekimashita.","en":"They were able to complete that game thoroughly.","words":[{"surface":"彼ら","vocabId":"1483090","reading":"かれら"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"その","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ゲーム","vocabId":null},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"やり","vocabId":"1400500","reading":"やり","baseForm":"やる"},{"surface":"切る","vocabId":"1384830","reading":"きる"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき","baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"まし","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ます"},{"surface":"た","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[7]}]}